{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣著名主持人蔡康永日前現身台北市長候選人沈伯洋選舉造勢場合，引發一連串爭議，昨日（25日）在清空多年的內地社交網上發文，調自己「沒有支持過台獨」，再度掀起熱議，對此，網紅Cheap發文狂寸：「人設真的崩得一塌糊塗，跟書上講得完全不一樣。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:35.323828+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T03:47:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:19.350995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:19.350995+00:00","content_hash":"15b459dea7d4117aa6b79ad7351c6fe4ba860bf8af24bb9e3009831015bee313","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}